# Collection artwork is checked out byte for byte on every platform.
#
# The manual publishes the SHA-256 of each plate, offers a checker that
# reproduces it, and fails the publication gate when a plate no longer hashes
# to its record. A line-ending conversion on one contributor's machine would
# break all three at once, so these files are never treated as text.
docs/assets/plates/*.svg -text

# The recorded digests live here. Same reason.
facts/collection-observed.json text eol=lf
facts/facts.json text eol=lf
